# .gitignore for mihaiionitabio-alt/lc480-ixo-qc-exportv2
# Paths match THIS repository's layout (documentation/latex/...), not the
# docs/latex/... layout of the never-built separate repository.

# --- never publish -----------------------------------------------------------
leak_identifiers.txt
# not just a folder called 2025_2: an SOP-v2 workstream on this machine keeps real
# laboratory material under examples/real-2025_2/ and in files named after it
*2025_2*
**/msyh.ttc
*pseudonym*map*.csv
*pseudonym*map*.json
*pseudonym*map*.xlsx
*E_JAXA-JERG-2-610B*
# real laboratory runs, by the shape of their names
SC_*GM[0-9][0-9]*.ixo
SC_*GM[0-9][0-9]*.eds
SC_*GM[0-9][0-9]*.edt
SC_*GM[0-9][0-9]*.rdml
lab12_fixture_*/
# pre-withdrawal snapshots
*.before_20260928_identifier_withdrawal

# --- the document source IS committed ---------------------------------------
# These were listed as build output when documentation/latex/ was the 25 September
# tree and the diagrams were regenerated.  documentation/latex/ is now the tree that
# builds the 28 September document, and fig/fndiag/, fig/gallery/, code/src/ and the
# generated chapters are its source.  Ignoring them silently dropped 1,047 of 1,057
# new files from a commit; the only reason it was caught is that someone counted.

# --- build litter ------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
_minted-*/
documentation/latex/main.pdf

# --- NOT ignored, deliberately ----------------------------------------------
# documentation/qPCR_QC_forensics_documentation_2026-09-28.pdf is the current
#   document, which documentation/latex/ builds, and is committed despite its 53 MB.
#   The superseded 25 September PDF was removed from the tree on 28 September (it
#   remains in the history); the 1,409-page document of 27 September was never
#   committed.
# documentation/latex/chV2_functions.tex is committed here: it IS the source of
#   record - 705 subsections, 705 diagrams.  The .before_singlecolumn_20260924 file
#   it was generated from (676 subsections, no diagrams) is not committed; the
#   generated chapter is a superset of it.

# --- local -------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
__pycache__/

# --- the combined build ------------------------------------------------------
# Appendices K, L and M bind ~5,300 pages of atlas, supplement, guide and annex
# into the document.  Those inputs are 208 MB and the combined PDF is larger
# still, well past GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, so both stay out of the
# repository and travel as a release asset instead.  The narrative volume builds
# from the committed sources with \atlasvolumesfalse.
documentation/latex/fig/atlas/
documentation/latex/volume_offsets.tsv
# The 7 October document is the complete one: 6,437 pages, 262 MB.  GitHub
# rejects any file over 100 MB, so it cannot be committed and travels as a
# release asset.  The sources and build_complete.sh are committed; the 28
# September PDF stays in the tree until its replacement is released.
documentation/qPCR_QC_forensics_documentation_2026-10-07.pdf
